'''Chiseled polished blackstone''' is the chiseled variation of [[polished blackstone]]. It has a [[piglin]] nose figure.

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
Chiseled polished blackstone needs to be broken using a pickaxe, otherwise the block drops nothing.
{{Breaking row
|horizontal=1
|Chiseled Polished Blackstone
|link=none
|Pickaxe
|Wood
}}

=== Natural generation ===
Chiseled polished blackstone can generate in [[bastion remnant]]s and [[ruined portal]]s.

=== Crafting ===
{{Crafting
|B2=Polished Blackstone Slab
|B3=Polished Blackstone Slab
|Output=Chiseled Polished Blackstone
|type=Building block
}}

=== Stonecutting ===
{{Stonecutting
|Polished Blackstone
|Chiseled Polished Blackstone
}}
== Usage ==
Chiseled polished blackstone is primarily used for decoration only.

=== Sulfur cube ===
{{In development|section=1|drop=Chaos Cubed}}
[[Sulfur cube]]s have the ability to absorb chiseled polished blackstone, either through picking it up or being interacted with it. This provides the regular/football effect to the mob when hitting it.

